Provider compatibility format references and adapted normalization logic
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Tokscale, junhoyeo/tokscale, revision a3209ff03da1b71262a4dd97bff854c07ca548b3:
OpenCode schema/message selection; Codex rollout/fork conventions; Claude
message identities; Grok updates/signals; ZCode token conventions; Cursor
export metadata; Antigravity sync artifact producer/reader contracts.
https://github.com/junhoyeo/tokscale/tree/a3209ff03da1b71262a4dd97bff854c07ca548b3

Token Monitor, Javis603/token-monitor, revision
e07aeb449353a6f9f0260292beacc27b643550c0: alternate Claude roots and cache
producer prerequisites. Its reviewed manifest identifies Tokscale base 4.15.1.
https://github.com/Javis603/token-monitor/tree/e07aeb449353a6f9f0260292beacc27b643550c0

No reference binaries, credentials, personal caches or private endpoints are
bundled or executed by these compatibility readers. Their metadata contracts
are observed interfaces, not vendor guarantees. BURNRATE does not adopt the
references' token estimates, current-model defaults or credential borrowing.

